 "scoring": "Per arm & replicate: guide LFC = log2(RPM+1) end - log2(RPM+1) T0 (arm's own T0; pDNA for DeWeirdt), guides with <30 T0 reads or bottom-2% T0 dropped, gene LFC = mean over guides (>=2), median-centred. GI(q,g) = LFC_g(q-KO) - running median of LFC_KO over genes ordered by LFC_WT (window n/40); z = residual / running MAD (floored at global MAD-SD), re-standardised per screen. Per-replicate z (KO rep A vs WT rep A, B vs B) = gi_rep1/gi_rep2; pooled z from replicate-mean LFCs. Query's own library row dropped. T0 = pDNA. PARP1 OVCAR-8/A375: both anchor guides pooled; gi_anchor1/gi_anchor2 = each anchor guide separately. Our z vs the authors' MOESM5 anchor z: Spearman 0.90-0.96 across all 9 genetic screens.",
