 "verdict": "include",
 "verdict_reason": "Independent anchor-guide replication 0.76/0.85 (PARP1), technical split-half 0.715/0.713 over labelled screens, scores match the authors' published z (rho 0.90-0.96), known biology recovered (BCL2L1<->MCL1 reciprocal, MARCHF5 and WSB2 with BCL2L1/MCL1, PARP1-PARP2/MUS81/EME1/GEN1 in HAP1). Hit rate 0.20% overall (255 pos; 0.12-0.77% per labelled screen) is at the low end of plausible, as expected for anchor screens. DepMap fitness AUROC 0.55; the own-screen control-arm LFC gives 0.79 because the LFC_anchor < -0.5 requirement ties positives to depletion. No same-line cross-study overlap with >=5 positives."
}